# IPAM environment variables — copy this file to `.env` for local overrides.
# All variables are optional; defaults work out of the box. See README.md
# ("Environment variables") for the canonical reference.

# --- Server ----------------------------------------------------------------
# PORT=8787
# IPAM_DATA_DIR=./data
# IPAM_DB=./data/ipam.db
# IPAM_UPLOAD_DIR=./data/uploads
# IPAM_DIST_DIR=./dist

# --- Docker (host-side port only) -----------------------------------------
# Maps the host port to the container's internal 8787. Leave unset (or 8787)
# for the default; override per-host in `/srv/ipam/.env` to avoid colliding
# with another process already bound to host :8787. Only the docker-compose
# ports mapping reads this; the in-process PORT stays 8787.
# IPAM_HOST_PORT=8787

# --- Sessions --------------------------------------------------------------
# Required in any non-dev deployment. Generate with, e.g.:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# If unset or shorter than 16 chars, the server logs a warning and uses a
# public dev-only fallback. Do not deploy with the fallback.
# IPAM_SESSION_SECRET=replace-me-with-32+-chars

# --- Client (Vite) ---------------------------------------------------------
# Read at build time by src/lib/api/http-client.ts. Only override if the
# API is not reachable at http://localhost:8787 (or whatever port PORT is).
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8787
